<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xmlns:py="http://codespeak.net/lxml/objectify/pytype" py:pytype="TREE"><text xml:lang="grc"><body><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" xml:lang="grc"><div type="textpart" subtype="episode"><sp><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" rend="indent" n="1">ὦ γῆς παλαιὸν ἄργος, Ἰνάχου ῥοαί,</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="2">ὅθεν ποτʼ ἄρας ναυσὶ χιλίαις Ἄρη</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="3">ἐς γῆν ἔπλευσε Τρῳάδʼ Ἀγαμέμνων ἄναξ.</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="4">κτείνας δὲ τὸν κρατοῦντʼ ἐν Ἰλιάδι χθονὶ</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="5">Πρίαμον, ἑλών τε Δαρδάνου κλεινὴν πόλιν,</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="6">ἀφίκετʼ ἐς τόδʼ Ἄργος, ὑψηλῶν δʼ ἐπὶ</l><l xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg012.perseus-grc2" n="7">ναῶν ἔθηκε σκῦλα πλεῖστα βαρβάρων.</l></sp></div></div></body></text></TEI>